@startuml
title Campaign State Transition Diagram

state Initial
state Activated
state AdPreparation
state ApprovedScheduled
state RunningAds
state Completed
state PaymentHandling
state PendingBalance
state Paid
state Archived

[*] --> Initial

Initial --> Activated : Approval and contract signing

Activated --> AdPreparation : Assign manager and staff

AdPreparation --> ApprovedScheduled : Ad approval and scheduling

ApprovedScheduled --> RunningAds : Scheduling done

RunningAds --> Completed : Campaign completion
RunningAds --> Activated : Extension/adjustment request

Completed --> PaymentHandling : Campaign completed

PaymentHandling --> Paid : Full amount paid correctly
PaymentHandling --> PendingBalance : Amount paid exceeds required

PendingBalance --> Paid : Balance settled

Paid --> Archived : Archive campaign

@enduml
